    <div id="modal-info"><div class="modal"><h3>786-MIII Ultimate</h3><p>Validated against R metafor.</p><button class="btn" onclick="app.toggleModal('modal-info')">Close</button></div></div>
    <div id="modal-csv"><div class="modal" style="max-width:800px">
        <h3>CSV Preparation Guide</h3>
        <div class="csv-guide">
            <h4>1. Binary Data (Events/Total)</h4>
            <pre>id, year, group, e1, n1, e2, n2
Study A, 2010, Hosp, 10, 100, 15, 100
Study B, 2012, Comm, 20, 150, 25, 150</pre>
            <h4>2. Continuous Data (Mean/SD)</h4>
            <pre>id, year, group, m1, s1, n1, m2, s2, n2
Study A, 2010, X, 5.5, 1.2, 50, 6.1, 1.3, 50</pre>
            <h4>3. Proportion Data (Single Arm)</h4>
            <pre>id, year, group, e, n
Study A, 2010, Y, 50, 200</pre>
            <h4>4. Survival Data (Hazard Ratio)</h4>
            <pre>id, year, group, hr, lci, uci, n1
Study A, 2010, Z, 0.75, 0.60, 0.90, 100</pre>
        </div>
